NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY IDEAS
-------------------------
SatarkPay ke kuch features *ideas* par based hain jo SANGYAN hackathon ke public
peer repositories me dikhe (negation-aware matching, client-side redaction,
registry-format validation, measured test-set evaluation, senior mode, voice
output, escalation ladder, deterministic pattern rules). Un repos me se KOI CODE
copy nahi kiya gaya — 31 me se 30 repos me koi license file hi nahi thi
(all rights reserved) aur 1 MIT tha. Poora idea-credit + "kya nahi liya" NOTICE.md
me hai. Ye MIT license sirf is repo ke original code par lagta hai.
